<title>TAIWAN: Far Eastern GDRs issued at 6 pct premium.</title>
<headline>Far Eastern GDRs issued at 6 pct premium.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's Far Eastern Textile said on Friday its US$60 million global depositary receipts (GDRs) issue had been completed at a premium of six percent.</p>
<p>A total of 3.05 million units, with 10 shares per unit, were issued at $19.67 per unit, a company spokeswoman said by telephone.</p>
<p>She said Far Eastern will use the funds to strengthen its overall financial structure.</p>
<p>Far Eastern is Taiwan's largest textile maker.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
